#### From mathcomp Require Import all_algebra all_ssreflect. From mathcomp Require Import reals. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit. Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Local Open Scope ring_scope. Variable R : realType. Variables A B C D E F : R * R. Variables x y : R. Hypotheses (HAB : dist A B = (1/4)*x + 5) (HBC : dist B C = (1/2)*x - 7) (HEF : dist E F = (1/3)*y - 6) (HED : dist E D = 66 - (2/3)*y) (angle_ABC : angle A B C = PI/2) (angle_BCD : angle B C D = PI/2) (A_B : exists k1, 0 < k1 < 1 /\B = ((1 - k1) *: A + k1 *: C)%R) (A_F : exists k2, 0 < k2 < 1 /\F = ((1 - k2) *: A + k2 *: E)%R). Theorem solve_xy: x = 24 /\y = 30. Proof. by []. Qed.
